This project is inspired by the orchestrator of T3 Code
(https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code, MIT License, Copyright (c) Ping Labs).
The tool surface (delegate a task, read its status, cancel it, list
capabilities), the task status vocabulary, the privilege ceiling between a
parent and its child tasks, and the orchestration instructions given to the
parent agent are adapted from T3 Code's "Orchestrator V2" design. No T3 Code
source code is included; orq reimplements the surface for Claude Code.

The detached job engine (supervisor script, event extraction, job directory
layout) derives from the author's earlier plugin "lanes" (MIT License).
